Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  钱德  摩妮卡  只剩一个香蕉坚果马芬{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, Chandler, Mon, there's only one banana-nut muffin left.{\r}
