Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  享受你的咖啡吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There you go. Enjoy your coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我到这里就已经在桌上了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That was there when I got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  你们绝对猜不到  谁要在来纽约{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, you guys, you will never guess who's coming to New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}快点  菲比  在他咽下去之前快告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Quick, Phoebe, tell us before he swallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好  是雷恩  和我约过会  在海军服役的那个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ryan, that guy I went out with who's in the Navy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你和在海军服役的人约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You went out with a guy in the Navy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  我在华盛顿广场公园  弹吉他时遇到他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, I met him while playing guitar in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}雷恩给我太妃糖  因为他没有零钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ryan threw in saltwater taffy because he didn't have change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  所以你就写了 《太妃糖人》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, is that when you wrote "Saltwater Taffy Man"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是  他是我的潜艇人 他每两年就会出水一次{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, he's my submarine guy. He resurfaces, like, every couple years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后我们就会一起度过最棒的三天{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and we have the most amazing three days together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只不过这一次  他会来两个星期  整整两个星期  也就是〝耶〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Only this time, he's coming for two weeks. Two whole weeks, which means "yay."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等  这家伙一潜到水底下  就是两年{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So wait, this guy goes down for, like, two years at a time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这就是舔我的马芬的代价{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That'll teach you to lick my muffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  糟糕  发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我刚才和卡萝通话  小班得了水痘{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just spoke to Carol. Ben's got chicken pox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  不  真是的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no. You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  所以如果你还没有得过  你很可能会得的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, so if you haven't had it, chances are you're gonna get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  我已经得过了  是啊  我得过了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I've had it. Yeah, I've had it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}得过了  得过了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Had it.  Had it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我从来没有得过  我觉得好孤单  哦  你看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've never had it. I feel so left out. Oh, look.{\r}
