Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马修·派瑞）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}亲爱的  你又铺好床了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Honey, you made the bed again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我告诉你  你不必这么做  这又不是营地{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I told you, you don't have to do that. This isn't camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以我猜昨晚偷内裤  是完全不必要的了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. Then I guess the panty raid last night was totally uncalled for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  我要去冲个澡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, I am going to take a shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：贝西·伯恩斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今天我会唱  吉姆克罗齐的《李洛伊布朗》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And today I will be singing Jim Croce's "Leroy Brown."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  摩妮卡  我有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Mon, I have a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}李洛伊是整个镇最坏的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is Leroy the baddest man in the whole damn town...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：布朗·曼德尔）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还是整个镇最胖的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...or the fattest man in the whole damn town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：麦可·连贝克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}最坏的  否则这首歌  就会是《肥肥李洛伊布朗》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The baddest. Otherwise, the song would be "Fat, Fat Leroy Brown."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只是在等待着你  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm just waiting for you, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在重铺床{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you remaking the bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对不起  对不起  你知道吗  你弄的根本没问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry, I'm sorry. You know what? The way you did it, it was just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那你重铺是因为…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then you're redoing it because?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果我告诉你  你会认为我疯了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If I tell you, you'll think I'm crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}反正已经无可避免了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're pretty much running that risk either way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  你看…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. You see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}棉被的标签不该是在左上角{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...the duvet tag shouldn't be at the top left corner...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}应该是在右下角{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...it should be at the bottom right corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗯  这不是太疯狂啊  我只是用简单的方法解释给你听{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Uh-huh. Well, that's not so crazy. - I'm just easing you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好  你有看到这些小花朵吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, you see these little flower blossoms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它们应该朝上  不是朝下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They should be facing up, not down...{\r}
